Generate the final per-order fulfillment JSON payload using:
- run metadata: {{run}}
- normalized_order: {{result.llm_result.validation.normalized_order}}
- full_order_details (if available): {{tool_result.order}}
- allocation_decision: {{result.llm_result.allocation_decision}}
- fulfillment_plan: {{result.llm_result.fulfillment_plan}}
- eligibility: {{result.llm_result.eligibility}}
